**Action:** none — this is an internal performance improvement delivered automatically with the 21.2.0 language service. Only re-verify if you embed `NgLanguageService` or the `@angular/language-service` TS plugin programmatically: verify that implementers of the interface provide `ensureProjectAnalyzed()` and that project warmup/external-file (`getExternalFiles()`) behaviour still meets expectations.

